  "description": "Private MP3 library for signed-in Jaylub users. Browse and search the shared track collection by title, artist, album, or ID; stream audio with playback and seek controls; keep playback while switching tabs; save personal favorites; create, play, and manage private playlists; and upload up to 25 MP3 files per batch, one at a time, up to 100 MiB per file. Install as a progressive web app. Offline mode caches the public app shell and offline notice only, never tracks, account pages, or APIs.",
